                "message": "Order modules by their package dependencies and defer heavy leaf modules\n\norg-ql moves after org-super-agenda (which it requires), sp-lisp loads\nbefore sp-prog-misc (emr requires paredit), twelve leaf modules load when\nEmacs is idle after startup, and docs/load-order.org graphs the order.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015tcMWj1Z6j2uCgMRYPBfDN",
